      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>matchLabels</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object (string)</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>matchLabels is a map of {"{"}key,value{"}"} pairs. A single {"{"}key,value{"}"} in the matchLabels map is equivalent to an element of matchExpressions, whose key field is "key", the operator is "In", and the values array contains only "value". The requirements are ANDed.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      </TableBody>
      </Table>
      <h3 id="_spectopologyspreadconstraintslabelselectormatchexpressions" class="group scroll-mt-20">.spec.topologySpreadConstraints[].labelSelector.matchExpressions<a href="#_spectopologyspreadconstraintslabelselectormatchexpressions" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
